<section class="problem">
  <div class="problem-inner">
    <p class="problem-lede">
      You are not losing work to better firms.
      <span class="hl">You are losing it to the phone ringing while everyone is already busy.</span>
    </p>
    <p class="problem-body">
      Most small teams do not have an enquiry problem. They have a Tuesday-afternoon problem. The
      calls arrive in the same hour as the job, the diary and the customer standing at the desk,
      so the ones that do not get answered quietly become someone else's work.
    </p>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  @reference "../../styles/global.css";

  .problem {
    background: var(--color-brand-bg);
    padding: 3.5rem 1.5rem 1rem;
  }
  .problem-inner {
    max-width: 820px;
    margin: 0 auto;
    text-align: center;
  }
  .problem-lede {
    font-family: var(--font-heading);
    font-weight: 600;
    font-size: clamp(1.4rem, 2.8vw, 2rem);
    line-height: 1.25;
    letter-spacing: -0.015em;
    color: var(--color-brand-ink);
    margin: 0 0 1.1rem;
    text-wrap: balance;
  }
  .hl {
    display: block;
    color: var(--color-brand-muted);
  }
  .problem-body {
    font-size: 1rem;
    line-height: 1.65;
    color: var(--color-brand-muted);
    margin: 0;
  }

  @media (max-width: 640px) {
    .problem { padding: 2.75rem 1.25rem 0.5rem; }
  }
</style>
